{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11111110","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11111110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1111111001:0":{"text":"你们没事吧。","source_cn":"你们没事吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7AD0C9F0149E13CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你们没事吧。","female":"你们没事吧。","variant_male_record_index":"123309","variant_female_record_index":"123310","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111111002:0":{"text":"嗯！我们一直相信，要是你和阿尔萨姐姐知道了，一定会来找我们！","source_cn":"嗯！我们一直相信，要是你和阿尔萨姐姐知道了，一定会来找我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738A1F1E5EEF29A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111111003:0":{"text":"所以不管那些坏家伙怎么欺负人，我们都要坚持下去！","source_cn":"所以不管那些坏家伙怎么欺负人，我们都要坚持下去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D72346BD6E721D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111111004:0":{"text":"咦……阿尔萨姐姐呢？","source_cn":"咦……阿尔萨姐姐呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0630C49569DCA04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1111111004":{"text":"咦……阿尔萨姐姐呢？","source_cn":"咦……阿尔萨姐姐呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0630C49569DCA04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111111005:0":{"text":"对不起，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style><male>哥哥</male><female>姐姐</female>，我，我们不该自己跑出来找宝藏……","source_cn":"对不起，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x13BD6EE14F0D9B49","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"对不起，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style><male>哥哥</male><female>姐姐</female>，我，我们不该自己跑出来找宝藏……","female":"对不起，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style><male>哥哥</male><female>姐姐</female>，我，我们不该自己跑出来找宝藏……","variant_male_record_index":"123314","variant_female_record_index":"123315","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111111006:0":{"text":"我、我们真的很想给索恩和阿尔萨帮忙……","source_cn":"我、我们真的很想给索恩和阿尔萨帮忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA60232406C0366D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111111007:0":{"text":"你们能照顾好自己，就是给阿尔萨和我分忧了。那个笨蛋担心得要死。","source_cn":"你们能照顾好自己，就是给阿尔萨和我分忧了。那个笨蛋担心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7C6642FF4484973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111111008:1":{"text":"这些娃娃就是你的族人？不错，眼神很棒，像是能成为猎人的好苗子。","source_cn":"这些娃娃就是你的族人？不错，眼神很棒，像是能成为猎人的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C7676A6CBC6CD60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111111009:1":{"text":"但这地方实在不宜久留。先把他们送走？","source_cn":"但这地方实在不宜久留。先把他们送走？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17D6568